# Market price authority (institutional)

## Single source of truth

All **customer-visible** spot USD references MUST resolve through:

- Server: `getSymbolSpotUsd()` / `getMarketPriceAuthority()` / `getMarketPriceAuthorityPayload()`
- Client: `useMarketPriceAuthority()` / `useMarketAuthoritySelector()` / `GET /api/market/authority`
- Historical charts: `GET /api/market/ohlcv` (server `lib/server/market-ohlcv-authority.ts`)

## Forbidden on customer surfaces

- Direct `fetch` to `api.binance.com`, `api.coingecko.com`, or other exchange tickers for **display pricing**
- `fetchMultiplePrices` / `fetchCoinPrice` from `lib/market-data.ts` calling CoinGecko directly (must use `/api/market/*` routes)
- New hooks that poll exchange APIs for UI prices

## Allowed exceptions (not customer spot display)

- `/api/market/compare` Bitget/KuCoin legs (venue spread diagnostics)
- User-authenticated `/api/binance`, `/api/binance-auth` (balances/orders)
- Analysis/simulation modules (`trade-comparison-engine`, `fast-paths-core`) until migrated — must not feed dashboard ticker

## New features

1. Add symbol to `lib/coingecko-symbol-map.ts` + `lib/market-price-reference-assets.ts` if needed
2. Extend `market-price-authority` provider chain — never add parallel client-side price fetch
3. Record provider success/failure via `market-price-health.ts`
4. Charts: only `/api/market/ohlcv` — no client CoinGecko OHLC

## Cache governance

- Server refresh: `MARKET_PRICE_CACHE_REFRESH_MS` (20s)
- Client poll: `MARKET_PRICE_CLIENT_POLL_MS` (45s), single bus subscriber ref-count
- Emergency last-good: max 15m, internal `stale` only (never expose provider errors in UI)
